I arrive at my work.
I work in a software company.
I walk into the large room.
My desk stands by the window.
Here I sit down on my chair.
I turn on my computer.
The screen lights up.
First I read my messages.
I have an email from my manager.
The email is about my new project.
I write a short reply.
Next I open my work program.
Now I write code for the project.
On the screen I see many colors.
I type quickly on my keyboard.
I concentrate closely on the code.
The work is exciting.
I drink a little water from my bottle.
I am very happy with my new job in Copenhagen.
